  "status": "DRAFT. No entry has been checked against a live provider page. Selectors come from the three extractors in this repository, which were themselves tested on mock pages at most. Share-link path shapes and the gemini-share strategy come from general knowledge and from one earlier review. Verify every entry against a real page, add a fixture, and record the date in `verified` before relying on it.",
